00:00:29.019 --> 00:00:31.979
So I figured I'd do it again even though we
now have slightly more views. By the way,

00:00:31.979 --> 00:00:36.000
if you don't believe that carbon dioxide emissions
contribute to climate change, that's... fine.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.430
Okay, so vlogbrothers videos have been viewed
about 122 million times; the average video

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.300
