00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.640
That's right, Hank. Nerdfighteria is already...
a Swede.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:26.750
And let me remind you, Hank, Nerdfighteria
is not even a person; it's an idea.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.980
On the upside, Hank, I already got rid of
23,000 pounds of our carbon emissions in 2007,

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:37.720
which means that now we only have 1.13 million
pounds of carbon to offset. It would take

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:43.120
