00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:47.450
that, Hank, uh, because someday, Henry is
gonna want to go to college.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.070
But, Hank, when you think about the fact that
Nerdfighteria is responsible for one million

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.820
pounds of carbon emissions and the vast majority
of people have never even heard the word "Nerdfighteria,"

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:59.420
it begins to give you a sense of how huge
the problem we're facing really is. I mean,

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:04.100
if you think about YouTube's carbon emissions,
you're talking about trillions of pounds of

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.100
carbon.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.820
I still think YouTube is awesome; I certainly
think Nerdfighteria is awesome, but Hank,

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:13.070
